/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 74 0 R
/T (The exploration showed how a low-code Zoho Creator application can be extended in two steps: a reusable Deluge custom function inside Creator, and a pro-code Zoho Catalyst function reached over HTTPS through a connection. An architecture, illustrative code, an execution flow and a decision guide were prepared for a loan application priority scoring extension of the Bank Loan Application Form.)
/E (The exploration showed how a low-code Zoho Creator application can be extended in two steps: a reusable Deluge custom function inside Creator, and a pro-code Zoho Catalyst function reached over HTTPS through a connection. An architecture, illustrative code, an execution flow and a decision guide were prepared for a loan application priority scoring extension of the Bank Loan Application Form.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
