491 0 obj
<<
/Title (The exploration showed how a low-code Zoho Creator application can be extended in two steps: a reusable Deluge custom function inside Creator, and a pro-code Zoho Catalyst function reached over HTTPS through a connection. An architecture, illustrative code, an execution flow and a decision guide were prepared for a loan application priority scoring extension of the Bank Loan Application Form.)
/Dest [16 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 417 0 R
/Next 576 0 R
>>
endobj
