<<
/Title (To explore how a loan application system built in Zoho Creator can be extended beyond low-code by using a reusable Deluge custom function and a pro-code serverless function on Zoho Catalyst, so that logic too involved for simple workflow actions can still be added.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 483 0 R
/Next 564 0 R
>>
endobj
564 0 obj
<<
/Title (A loan application priority scoring example is used to show how the two parts connect, when each option is appropriate, and which precautions a real implementation needs.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 483 0 R
/Prev 563 0 R
>>
endobj
565 0 obj
<<
/Title (Compare the options. Workflow actions, Deluge custom functions, a Creator Custom API and a Catalyst function were compared on skill needed and typical use \(Section 3.2\).)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 414 0 R
/Prev 484 0 R
/Next 618 0 R
>>
