568 0 obj
<<
/Title (Zoho Creator keeps the form and the workflow. After a successful submission the workflow calls a Deluge custom function, which sends an HTTPS request through a connection to an Advanced I/O function on Zoho Catalyst. The Catalyst function runs the scoring logic, can use its own storage or an outside API if needed, and returns a JSON response that the workflow stores in the record.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 486 0 R
/Next 622 0 R
>>
endobj
569 0 obj
<<
/Title (3.3 Deluge custom function \(illustrative\))
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 486 0 R
/Prev 622 0 R
>>
endobj
570 0 obj
<<
/Title (The custom function packs the request once, so any workflow can reuse it. The workflow passes the loan tenure in days, the interest rate and the reason for the loan, receives the priority level and stores it with a criteria-based update on ID == input.ID. The URL, connection, form and field names are placeholders.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 487 0 R
/Next 623 0 R
>>
endobj
